# Crash resistance / non-interference (Caminada, Carnielli & Dunne 2012):
# a strictly inconsistent but unrelated pair (Z and ~Z, both strict) must
# not change the status of an unrelated issue. Tweety flies by a presumed
# rule; Z is asserted and denied outright.
lk.
declare Bird, Flies, Z : bool.
declare bird : (Bird).
declare z : (Z).
deny not_z : (Z).
argument tweety : (Flies).
cut (Bird -> Flies) r.
by default.
next.
elim.
axiom bird.
axiom r.
dixi.
argument zpro : (Z).
axiom z.
dixi.
counterargument zcon : (Z).
moxia not_z.
dixi.
